        {
          "es": "En la arena, las moscas y las aves marinas rodearon aquel bulto extraño.",
          "en": "On the sand, flies and seabirds gathered around the strange bundle."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde el cielo lo vio Tama-nui-ki-te-rangi, un antepasado de Māui.",
          "en": "From the sky, Tama-nui-ki-te-rangi saw them. He was an ancestor of Māui."
        },
        {
          "es": "Bajó corriendo y apartó a las aves y las medusas.",
          "en": "He hurried down and brushed away the birds and the jellyfish."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y adentro encontró a un bebé humano, vivo.",
          "en": "And inside, he found a living human baby."
