        {
          "es": "Māui la siguió. La vio levantar una mata de juncos y meterse en un agujero que había debajo.",
          "en": "Māui followed her. He saw her lift a clump of rushes and slip down a hole underneath."
        },
        {
          "es": "Él quería seguirla. Así que se puso la faja de su madre y se transformó en kererū, una paloma del bosque.",
          "en": "He wanted to follow. So he put on his mother's belt, and turned himself into a kererū, a wood pigeon."
        },
        {
          "es": "La historia dice que de esa faja viene el pecho blanco del kererū.",
          "en": "The story says that is where the kererū got its white chest: from his mother's belt."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú habrías seguido a tu madre por ese agujero?",
          "en": "Would you have followed your mother down that hole?"
