      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El kererū bajó volando por el agujero, hasta el mundo de abajo.",
          "en": "The kererū flew down the hole, into the world below."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí vio gente descansando bajo un árbol. Entre ellos estaban su madre y su padre, Makeatutara.",
          "en": "There he saw people resting under a tree. Among them were his mother, and his father, Makeatutara."
        },
        {
          "es": "Māui se posó en el árbol y les tiró bayas.",
          "en": "Māui perched in the tree and threw berries down at them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después bajó al suelo y volvió a ser un hombre joven.",
          "en": "Then he came down to the ground and turned back into a young man."
        },
        {
          "es": "Taranga lo reconoció enseguida. «Este es nuestro hijo menor», le dijo a su esposo.",
          "en": "Taranga knew him at once. 'This is our youngest son,' she told her husband."
        }
